{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "155213584cf4e57fa4cd99f630df80f1a5a5ffa3ddcb7a2242c53ad1800ce2f3", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドルを探し求めていた、\nある日……）", "zh": "（在我为39PROJECT\n找寻偶像的某一天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f65cd21d86850711308041fb91ff42fb3968fbcc198fef03e6990ef69bd025e4", "ja": "（突然、緊急の用事だからと\n社長に呼び出された俺は……）", "zh": "（社长突然说有急事，\n把我找了过去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "429d2c10dd7369c30a1b5819c9eeb42e6d106dc2db670ed3c18021829b52883c", "ja": "（はるばる北海道までやって来た。\n遠くから聞こえてくるのは……ああ、牛の声か……）", "zh": "（结果我就这样千里迢迢跑来北海道了。\n远方传来的是……喔喔，是牛的叫声吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1004_president", "source_sha256": "cb0dfc65b86c8883a49db351da360b24de84fe365208ae2726c51f508d2daf0a", "ja": "やあ、君！　よく来てくれたね。\nほら、ひなた君、挨拶挨拶。", "zh": "哎呀，是你！真高兴你来了。\n日向，过来吧，打声招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "94c26553739f9668e2309e62b3979e051c330922b8593c089ef11d203fb20a3f", "ja": "あんたが、プロデューサーっちゅう人かい？\nはじめまして。", "zh": "你就是那个制作人吗？\n你好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "67d5abc21646e2e6cc0aa156e7add9f9db0428e9214cbdf66a8ad10e04fbfc54", "ja": "あたし、木下ひなたって言うんだわあ。\nよろしくねぇ。", "zh": "我叫做木下日向哪～\n请多指教呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1007_president", "source_sha256": "a21ce63f17722400d6c6366d59ccc96937094b9ef0e42168706f0b6267d3fd72", "ja": "たまたま、この町のリンゴ祭に観光……オホン！\nいや、視察に来ていてだね！", "zh": "我碰巧来这小镇的苹果祭观光……咳咳！\n我是说来视察！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1008_president", "source_sha256": "8f56d5b3628d70fe2271bc1c743b924848f37d2751ba094271828c60b4558ffd", "ja": "リンゴ祭では、歌の大会もあるわけだが……", "zh": "这苹果祭有举办歌唱大赛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1009_president", "source_sha256": "48df4726c7eec1582b467be6a09c4c0c4fce8df998d66fdced568aa13a7d00c0", "ja": "そこで今年の歌姫、リンゴ姫に選ばれたのが、\nこのひなた君だったんだ！", "zh": "今年的歌唱冠军，当选苹果公主的人，\n就是这位日向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e3ca4546a497ee3c90b3e73d3863b195d29ae73ad87f6dbf4b52fe5dc1088807", "ja": "へえ……じゃあ、歌が上手なんですね！", "zh": "这样啊……这么说来，你的歌喉很棒啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "1085ec2476a6394eddac550dc621d218ba6a7936b4034d01f0feda06d4b408f5", "ja": "えへへ、上手ってほどではないけども……。\nあたし、歌を歌うのは好きだよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，应该没有到很棒……\n只是，我很喜欢唱歌哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1012_president", "source_sha256": "f1a8b3bce1d04c55c6d210441b961fc8591332d59f09ac93eaf9e489d27db5bd", "ja": "うんうん、いい笑顔だろう？　彼女をひと目見て、\n39プロジェクトのアイドルに相応しいと思ってね。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，她的笑容很棒吧？我一看到她啊，\n就觉得她很适合来当39PROJECT的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1013_president", "source_sha256": "8c6e3602f491db0b0ac052b0099a6b839935df4505414c21eb3b689acc90b9ff", "ja": "そこで、君を呼んだのだよ！", "zh": "所以就把你叫来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f9adfffc8018eb88ba0a7e1d699904cf20d760bb32e3e4e9daf87547a8b75676", "ja": "なるほど。そういうことでしたか……。\n急に北海道に呼び出されたから、驚きましたよ。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么一回事啊……\n社长突然要我来北海道，真是吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c63d9fe791e845ded08d193d0b04793e8c43db07b5470d2961f1575f5f129cd", "ja": "あたしもね、最初に声を掛けられた時は、\nなまらびっくりしたよぉ。", "zh": "我也是，一开始社长来找我时，\n我也吃了特大一惊啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "544e8f4a0378ea7cf44febd8fd0bb31e72043b36b89a48113070c0b9ddcfe66b", "ja": "まさかこんなところに、東京のアイドル事務所の\n社長さんがいるとは、思わなかったからねぇ。", "zh": "想不到东京的偶像事务所的社长\n会出现在我们镇上呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2d0d10569f3df36f60cd3b87f8af71b98b2415710257b074af96ebcad08c8985", "ja": "はは、そうだよね。\nところで君、アイドルになりたいのかな？", "zh": "哈哈，就是说啊。\n对了，你想要当偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "30e1b6c58d7dcb2abfaef9745ecc96218d4ab20784ac6aedc800dcdaf5c0de29", "ja": "あ、あたしが、アイドルにかい？\nでもアイドルって、キラキラしてるべさ……。", "zh": "我、我去当偶像吗？\n可是偶像都很光鲜亮丽哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "78fb183d3875d5785e08267fb0796c5d8c0734120d3921f70b98c1525a981691", "ja": "そうだね、キラキラしてるかな。\nアイドルを見たことはある？", "zh": "这个嘛，的确都挺光鲜亮丽的。\n你见过偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3bd0fc076eb64d6d955a41f7a8ea68dc7929d0dc8abbd4a01b1c9b914724b20", "ja": "うん。\nテレビに出てるとね、家族みんなで見るよぉ。", "zh": "嗯。\n在电视上看到偶像，我们全家都会一起看哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "24909ec0b5fe50311158515dd2b48c240364524134512c4a609a32d062d140ed", "ja": "あたしね、小さい頃から歌が好きで、\nいっつも農園で歌ってたんだわぁ。", "zh": "我呀，从小就很喜欢唱歌，\n总是在农园里头唱歌哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "74d321f8b7c5cff34f3d9bfaee5d417055fb4ab9a66ad3c10e38829baf629731", "ja": "そしたらばあちゃんが、色々教えてくれたんだよぉ。\nアイドル、っちゅう仕事があるんだよって。", "zh": "然后奶奶就告诉我很多事情哦～\n她跟我说有个职业叫做偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "456accbac1dc1947dc5ab4a58830a748a5acb0a177d6301a757479db5cc258f2", "ja": "その憧れの世界を、\n自分の目で見てみたいと思う？", "zh": "那你想不想亲眼看看\n那个令人向往的世界呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "6db5bc8a0e8b6f88a35ec2541dd78398a65c4986e258cd2e886b313419d04aee", "ja": "……。\nうん……。", "zh": "……\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "6afee62280b918e1cede128dd251fa9c278ead803e747e292b35641dcaa75201", "ja": "あっ……でも、あたしなんかに、アイドルが\nできるのかどうかは、わからんけども……。", "zh": "啊……不过，像我这样的人，\n不知道有没有办法当偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "0f616874a6fdb0cffc9a709e0da5970b596e541f1ba8d7f8bc8fae44c1153873", "ja": "でも……あたし、アイドルの世界を見てみたい。\n……こんな返事じゃ、やっぱしダメだろか……？", "zh": "可是……我还是想看看偶像的世界。\n……这样的回答，是不是不行哪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1027_p", "source_sha256": "48eab058e1fec03ab26637da7f21c1cf9b6107f06bc362d882cbbea3a10b8877", "ja": "（アイドルに対する純粋な憧れ、それに\n自然な笑顔……これは、いい武器になるぞ！）", "zh": "（对偶像的单纯向往，再加上\n这自然的笑容……肯定会是很棒的武器！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_1028", "source_sha256": "5c405ac0d8e3f05b75a1875a1927e29edd80a8a42ef23f7968e7b78a19aea025", "ja": "アイドルになってほしい", "zh": "希望你能来当偶像", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c0603cce9bf209ff0e8c7d2f6c5564bae0fbab3b48d1d598778c2537528b57b9", "ja": "アイドルになってほしい。\n俺に、君をプロデュースさせてくれないか？", "zh": "我希望你能来当偶像。\n可以让我培育你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2001_035hin", "source_sha256": "3de40528c9a82e949234174d101ad348890fd78846663eefe1cf9bdddb788527", "ja": "……。\nうん。", "zh": "……\n嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "491fccd817784737bb6978bb358a5092435c2ab820d2351194c53585a13cdbfa", "ja": "よかった！\nこれから、一緒に頑張ろうな。", "zh": "太好了！\n从今以后一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2003_035hin", "source_sha256": "6110af2f686a1d5f2c9f77b06dfcb20087424609ab3f32914aaf62638e5aa202", "ja": "うん。あたしのほうこそ、よろしく頼みます。", "zh": "嗯，彼此彼此，要请你多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2004_035hin", "source_sha256": "92c3d8178ab17f8e1bafef28255e3f49277d7421ec87dc1dc9160e20315e545a", "ja": "あたし、アイドルのこと、なぁんも知らんし。\n迷惑かけるかもしれんけど……", "zh": "关于偶像我一点都不了解。\n可能会给你造成困扰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2005_035hin", "source_sha256": "f607e39c8f6edf155418efb71e157d3a38202c1fefdd3154f1a70afc8bcf1daf", "ja": "一生懸命、覚えるから。\nあたしにアイドル、教えてねぇ。", "zh": "不过我会拚命学习的。\n要教我怎么当个偶像哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "0a1498ff841c295c988e7f4956540739376cdfc057f5524d6f784e1378e6fdf3", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！", "zh": "好，当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2007_president", "source_sha256": "8c19f4f7b4012b62a1b6e4dfb58bdc757d3af0ec3e4f5190d96aaf25b992bf4d", "ja": "うむ！　話が進んでるようでなによりだよ！\nはっはっはっはっは……！", "zh": "很好！看来事情有进展了，非常好！\n哈哈哈哈哈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2008_president", "source_sha256": "2ca18fee2a76df1164cc8a94fbcc3714ed7faa75ec727cd03f706faf2350c366", "ja": "……私がいなくても、大丈夫だったかな？", "zh": "……我不在场应该也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "8cd69542efbb5232d9e14b7a77018a15145f4e2fe4d528a0eb3ca31eb1d04724", "ja": "（木下ひなた……この素朴な感じ、今までのアイドルに\nないタイプだ。大事にプロデュースしていこう！）", "zh": "（木下日向……这种朴实的感觉，目前的偶像中\n还没有同样类型的。我要用心地培育她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
